---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 200 Common English Phrasal Verbs with Bangla Meaning | Mane
description: Learn 200 common English phrasal verbs with Bangla meanings, English meanings, examples, and topic filters for practical use.
ogType: article
bodyClass: legal-page resources-page
permalink: resources/200-common-english-phrasal-verbs-bangla/index.html
styles:
  - /styles/resources.css
scripts:
  - /scripts/common-english-phrasal-verbs.bundle.js
  - /scripts/sentences.js
ctaContent: resources_vocab_nav
faqItems:
  - question: Who is this phrasal verbs list for?
    answer: This resource is for Bangla-speaking learners who want to understand and use common English phrasal verbs in everyday conversation.
  - question: What does English meaning mean here?
    answer: English meaning gives a short definition of the phrasal verb so you can understand the core idea before seeing the example.
  - question: How is this list organized?
    answer: The phrasal verbs are grouped by topic so you can browse similar expressions together and learn them in context.
---
{% set resource = resources.commonEnglishPhrasalVerbs %}
<div class="blog-shell resources-page">
  <div class="page">
    {% include 'partials/legal-header.njk' %}

    <main data-resource-page data-resource-name="200-common-english-phrasal-verbs-bangla" data-resource-loader="__loadManeCommonPhrasalVerbs">
      <article class="resource-shell">
        <header class="resource-hero">
          <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a>
            <span class="breadcrumbs__divider" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="{{ resource.hubPath | url }}">Resources</a>
            <span class="breadcrumbs__divider" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span aria-current="page">{{ resource.shortTitle }}</span>
          </nav>
          <h1 class="resource-title">{{ resource.title }}<span class="resource-title__accent">.</span></h1>
          <p class="resource-lead">Search by phrasal verb, English meaning, Bangla meaning, or example.</p>
          <p class="resource-meta-line">{{ resource.wordCountLabel }} phrasal verbs • {{ resource.topicCountLabel }} topics</p>
        </header>

        <section class="resource-toolbar" aria-label="Phrasal verbs search">
          <div class="resource-toolbar__row resource-toolbar__row--search-only">
            <label class="resource-search-wrap">
              <span class="sr-only">Search the phrasal verbs list</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.7-3.7"></path></svg>
              <input class="resource-search-input" id="word-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Search phrasal verb, meaning, or example…">
            </label>
            <button class="resource-reset-button" id="reset-filters" type="button">Reset</button>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="resource-footer-cta" aria-label="Download Mane app">
          <img src="{{ site.icon | url }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
          <div>
            <h2>Practice phrasal verbs inside Mane.</h2>
            <p>Use Mane for offline lookup, Banglish search, saved items, and quick review after you finish this list.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="resource-footer-cta__button" href="{{ resource.ctaFooterContent | playUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-resource-play-store="footer">Get Mane on Google Play</a>
        </section>

        <section class="resource-search-results" id="resource-search-results" hidden aria-labelledby="resource-search-results-title">
          <div class="resource-search-results__header">
            <p class="resource-kicker">Search results</p>
            <h2 id="resource-search-results-title">Matching phrasal verbs.</h2>
            <p class="resource-search-results__count" id="resource-search-results-count" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>
          <div class="resource-search-results__grid" id="resource-search-results-grid"></div>
          <div class="resource-empty-state" id="resource-empty-state" hidden>
            <strong>No phrasal verbs matched.</strong>
            <span>Try another keyword or topic.</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="resource-content resource-content--split" id="resource-browse-section">
          <aside class="resource-sidebar" aria-label="Phrasal verbs topics">
            <div class="resource-sidebar__inner">
              <div class="resource-sidebar__block">
                <p class="resource-sidebar__label">Browse topics</p>
                <nav class="resource-topic-list" aria-label="Filter by topic">
                  <a class="resource-topic-link is-active" href="#resource-topics" data-topic-filter="all" data-topic-label="all topics" aria-current="true">
                    <span>All topics</span>
                    <strong>{{ resource.wordCountLabel }}</strong>
                  </a>
                  {% for topic in resource.topics %}
                    <a class="resource-topic-link" href="#{{ topic.id }}" data-topic-filter="{{ topic.slug }}" data-topic-label="{{ topic.title }}" aria-current="false">
                      <span>{{ topic.title }}</span>
                      <strong>{{ topic.countLabel }}</strong>
                    </a>
                  {% endfor %}
                </nav>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>

          <div class="resource-main">
            <div class="resource-topic-grid" id="resource-topics">
            {% for topic in resource.topics %}
              <details class="resource-topic-card" id="{{ topic.id }}" data-topic="{{ topic.slug }}" {% if loop.index0 < 2 %}open{% endif %}>
                <summary>
                  <span class="resource-topic-number">{{ topic.number }}</span>
                  <span class="resource-topic-heading">
                    <strong><a href="#{{ topic.id }}">{{ topic.title }}</a></strong>
                    {% if topic.titleBn %}<small lang="bn">{{ topic.titleBn }}</small>{% endif %}
                  </span>
                  <span class="resource-topic-count"><span class="resource-topic-visible-count">{{ topic.countLabel }}</span> / {{ topic.countLabel }}</span>
                  <span class="resource-summary-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </summary>
                <div class="resource-phrasal-table" role="table" aria-label="{{ topic.title }} phrasal verbs">
                  <div class="resource-phrasal-head" role="row">
                    <div role="columnheader" aria-label="Serial number" title="Serial number">#</div>
                    <div role="columnheader">Phrasal verb</div>
                    <div role="columnheader">বাংলা অর্থ</div>
                    <div role="columnheader">Example</div>
                  </div>
                  {% for phrasalVerb in topic.phrasalVerbs %}
                    <article class="resource-phrasal-row" id="{{ phrasalVerb.id }}" role="row">
                      <div class="resource-word-cell resource-word-cell--sequence" role="cell">{{ phrasalVerb.sequence }}</div>
                      <div class="resource-word-cell resource-word-cell--phrasal" role="cell"><a href="#{{ phrasalVerb.id }}">{{ phrasalVerb.phrasalVerb }}</a></div>
                      <div class="resource-word-cell resource-word-cell--meaning" role="cell" lang="bn">{{ phrasalVerb.banglaMeaning }}</div>
                      <div class="resource-word-cell resource-word-cell--example" role="cell">
                        <div>{{ phrasalVerb.example }}</div>
                        <small lang="bn">{{ phrasalVerb.exampleBangla }}</small>
                      </div>
                    </article>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              </details>
            {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="resource-faq" aria-labelledby="resource-faq-title">
          <p class="resource-kicker">Helpful notes</p>
          <h2 id="resource-faq-title">Before you study.</h2>
          <div class="resource-faq-grid">
            {% for item in faqItems %}
              <article class="resource-faq-card">
                <h3>{{ item.question }}</h3>
                <p>{{ item.answer }}</p>
              </article>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>

      <script type="application/ld+json">
        {
          "@context": "https://schema.org",
          "@graph": [
            {
              "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
              "itemListElement": [
                {
                  "@type": "ListItem",
                  "position": 1,
                  "name": "Home",
                  "item": {{ ('/' | url) | absoluteUrl | dump | safe }}
                },
                {
                  "@type": "ListItem",
                  "position": 2,
                  "name": "Resources",
                  "item": {{ (resource.hubPath | url) | absoluteUrl | dump | safe }}
                },
                {
                  "@type": "ListItem",
                  "position": 3,
                  "name": {{ resource.title | dump | safe }},
                  "item": {{ page.url | absoluteUrl | dump | safe }}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "LearningResource",
              "name": {{ resource.title | dump | safe }},
              "description": {{ description | dump | safe }},
              "url": {{ page.url | absoluteUrl | dump | safe }},
              "isPartOf": {{ (resource.hubPath | url) | absoluteUrl | dump | safe }},
              "inLanguage": ["en", "bn"],
              "learningResourceType": "Phrasal verb list",
              "educationalLevel": ["Beginner", "Elementary", "Intermediate"],
              "numberOfItems": {{ resource.wordCount }},
              "isAccessibleForFree": true,
              "provider": {
                "@type": "Organization",
                "name": {{ site.name | dump | safe }},
                "url": {{ site.siteOrigin | dump | safe }}
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "ItemList",
              "name": "Phrasal verb topics",
              "numberOfItems": {{ resource.topicCount }},
              "itemListElement": [
                {% for topic in resource.topics %}
                {
                  "@type": "ListItem",
                  "position": {{ loop.index }},
                  "name": {{ topic.title | dump | safe }},
                  "url": {{ ((page.url | absoluteUrl) ~ '#' ~ topic.id) | dump | safe }},
                  "numberOfItems": {{ topic.count }}
                }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      </script>
    </main>

    {% include 'partials/legal-footer.njk' %}
  </div>
</div>
